// `@optional @external` on one member, with a value
// The two annotations answer different questions: DDS-XTypes 1.3
// Table 21 says where the binding holds the value, and §7.2.2.4.4.4.7
// whether it is there at all. Neither changes an octet the plain
// `@optional` member would not write.
@final struct Sample {
    long a;
    @optional @external long b;
    long c;
};
